{"4646130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Green Clicker", "steam_appid": 4646130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Clicker</strong> is a minimalist clicking game built around one simple goal: click the green square and unlock every achievement Steam will let you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex systems, no skill trees, no hidden mechanics. Just you, a glowing green square, and 100 achievements waiting to be unlocked — from your very first click all the way to one million.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Steam achievements spanning click milestones, time played, clicks per second, and combo streaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, satisfying click feedback with ripple animations and floating counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time achievement notifications so you always know when you've earned something</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live clicks-per-second tracker to measure your peak performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleek green neon aesthetic with a animated background grid and orbiting rings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full achievement panel so you can track exactly where you stand</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a achievement hunter looking to pad your completion rate, or just someone who finds clicking oddly satisfying, Green Clicker delivers exactly what it promises — nothing more, nothing less.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Clicker</strong> is a minimalist clicking game built around one simple goal: click the green square and unlock every achievement Steam will let you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex systems, no skill trees, no hidden mechanics. Just you, a glowing green square, and 100 achievements waiting to be unlocked — from your very first click all the way to one million.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Steam achievements spanning click milestones, time played, clicks per second, and combo streaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, satisfying click feedback with ripple animations and floating counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time achievement notifications so you always know when you've earned something</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live clicks-per-second tracker to measure your peak performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleek green neon aesthetic with a animated background grid and orbiting rings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full achievement panel so you can track exactly where you stand</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a achievement hunter looking to pad your completion rate, or just someone who finds clicking oddly satisfying, Green Clicker delivers exactly what it promises — nothing more, nothing less.</p>", "short_description": "Click the green square and unlock 100 Steam achievements. Track your progress, build your click streak, and rise from your first click to one million. Simple mechanics, pure satisfaction.", "supported_languages": "Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646130/30c36815415c148d75911d314a3922279f72f444/header.jpg?t=1778928375", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646130/b0870c1691dcd6d5bdbb824e2a0833241046c6da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778928375", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646130/b0870c1691dcd6d5bdbb824e2a0833241046c6da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778928375", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>